  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes QuLTSF, a hybrid model combining classical linear layers with a 10‑qubit, 3‑layer variational quantum circuit. On the Weather dataset (52,696 timestamps, 21 features) with sequence length L=336, QuLTSF achieves MSE values of 0.156, 0.199, 0.248, and 0.315 for prediction horizons T={96,192,336,720}, outperforming classical linear models such as Linear (0.176 MSE at T=96) and DLinear (0.176). All experiments were performed using a simulator on a classical GPU cluster.",
